{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":996026,"ns":0,"title":"Commonsense reasoning","extract":"In artificial intelligence (AI), commonsense reasoning is a human-like ability to make presumptions about the type and essence of ordinary situations humans encounter every day. These assumptions include judgments about the nature of physical objects, taxonomic properties, and peoples' intentions.","description":"Branch of artificial intelligence aiming to create AI systems with \"common sense\"","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}